{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01065",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 4.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.13,
      "end_seconds": 9.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.58,
      "end_seconds": 15.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.34,
      "end_seconds": 20.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.86,
      "end_seconds": 28.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Actually, uh, so the thing is, I've got bloating after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.32,
      "end_seconds": 32.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.34,
      "end_seconds": 36.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Probably about two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.15,
      "end_seconds": 40.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.57,
      "end_seconds": 46.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "A six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.88,
      "end_seconds": 50.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "What aggravates it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.19,
      "end_seconds": 72.91,
      "duration_seconds": 21.72,
      "text": "Yeah, it's worse with fizzy drinks and large meals. And loose stools now and then as well, since last Tuesday. Um, you know, about loose stools now and then, I notice it more with stress. And a lot of wind as well, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.5,
      "end_seconds": 77.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.66,
      "end_seconds": 88.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.88,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 85 beats a minute, temp 36.5 degrees. And SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 115 over 77, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.49,
      "end_seconds": 122.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.45,
      "end_seconds": 127.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.11,
      "end_seconds": 141.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender, and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.95,
      "end_seconds": 151.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Did you get weight loss, vomiting, blood in the stool or night-time diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 156.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.62,
      "end_seconds": 162.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.97,
      "end_seconds": 171.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.22,
      "end_seconds": 176.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.93,
      "end_seconds": 183.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.88,
      "end_seconds": 201.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.65,
      "end_seconds": 205.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.7,
      "end_seconds": 210.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.16,
      "end_seconds": 215.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.52,
      "end_seconds": 219.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.7,
      "end_seconds": 226.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.0,
      "end_seconds": 244.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.96,
      "end_seconds": 251.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. Peppermint capsules, after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.67,
      "end_seconds": 256.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.64,
      "end_seconds": 260.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.48,
      "end_seconds": 271.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.28,
      "end_seconds": 275.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Anxiety, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.19,
      "end_seconds": 280.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.28,
      "end_seconds": 286.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.66,
      "end_seconds": 294.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.06,
      "end_seconds": 298.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.22,
      "end_seconds": 312.65,
      "duration_seconds": 13.43,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features at this stage. I can't rule out irritable bowel syndrome yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.55,
      "end_seconds": 316.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.28,
      "end_seconds": 341.74,
      "duration_seconds": 23.46,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features do well once it's treated properly. A coeliac blood test is what I'd like next, for bloating. Try smaller meals and keep a food and symptom diary for four weeks. I'll want another look in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.63,
      "end_seconds": 345.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.96,
      "end_seconds": 351.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.84,
      "end_seconds": 356.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.52,
      "end_seconds": 358.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}